  },
  {
   "id": "pyn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 886,
   "y": 548,
   "width": 173,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100057,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700399,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the CDN caches better",
   "originalText": "the CDN caches better",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "pyd2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 886,
   "y": 570,
   "width": 606,
   "height": 30,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100058,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "one hot ocean tile is a single cached object at each edge, instead of billions of\ndistinct COLD objects - directly attacking the cold-tile problem.",
   "originalText": "one hot ocean tile is a single cached object at each edge, instead of billions of\ndistinct COLD objects - directly attacking the cold-tile problem.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 526,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700413,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why object storage and not a database: the access pattern is 'fetch this\nimmutable blob by key', the objects are large-ish, and they are never queried by\nattribute. A database would layer query planning, transactions and indexing over\nwhat is fundamentally a file read - and no relational or document store is\ndesigned for trillions of rows of opaque bytes.",
   "originalText": "Why object storage and not a database: the access pattern is 'fetch this\nimmutable blob by key', the objects are large-ish, and they are never queried by\nattribute. A database would layer query planning, transactions and indexing over\nwhat is fundamentally a file read - and no relational or document store is\ndesigned for trillions of rows of opaque bytes.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 626,
   "width": 987,
   "height": 32,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100060,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700420,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "In practice tile_index is not even a live lookup on the read path: the CDN URL encodes (version, z, x, y) directly and the\norigin resolves it - so the index is consulted only on the ~1% of requests that miss the edge.",
   "originalText": "In practice tile_index is not even a live lookup on the read path: the CDN URL encodes (version, z, x, y) directly and the\norigin resolves it - so the index is consulted only on the ~1% of requests that miss the edge.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 680,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
