  {
   "id": "rev_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 888,
   "y": 1929,
   "width": 784,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100089,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700623,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "REVERSE   given a point, find the nearest addressable feature\n  -> an R-TREE or S2 CELL INDEX over address points and\n     street geometry\n\na spatial query, not a text one",
   "originalText": "REVERSE   given a point, find the nearest addressable feature\n  -> an R-TREE or S2 CELL INDEX over address points and\n     street geometry\n\na spatial query, not a text one",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rev",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2052,
   "width": 1027,
   "height": 48,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100090,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700630,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why a text-search engine and not a relational table: the query is fuzzy, multilingual, abbreviation-tolerant and typo-tolerant,\nand WHERE address = ? answers approximately none of the queries people actually type. Conflating the two directions is a common\ndesign error - they share a product feature and nothing else.",
   "originalText": "Why a text-search engine and not a relational table: the query is fuzzy, multilingual, abbreviation-tolerant and typo-tolerant,\nand WHERE address = ? answers approximately none of the queries people actually type. Conflating the two directions is a common\ndesign error - they share a product feature and nothing else.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "fn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2126,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100091,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "precision level is returned because it is honest AND actionable: ROOFTOP means the exact building, while RANGE_INTERPOLATED\nmeans interpolated along a street segment and possibly tens of metres off. A navigation client should route to the STREET for\nthe latter rather than pretending to a precision it does not have. Results are heavily cached, since the same addresses are\nsearched repeatedly and a plain LRU absorbs most traffic.",
   "originalText": "precision level is returned because it is honest AND actionable: ROOFTOP means the exact building, while RANGE_INTERPOLATED\nmeans interpolated along a street segment and possibly tens of metres off. A navigation client should route to the STREET for\nthe latter rather than pretending to a precision it does not have. Results are heavily cached, since the same addresses are\nsearched repeatedly and a plain LRU absorbs most traffic.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d7",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 2216,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
